bluetooth-autoconnect (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Detect paired and trusted Bluetooth devices via BlueZ D-Bus.
    - One-shot scan-and-connect mode and long-running --daemon mode.
    - Exponential backoff retries, concurrent connections.
    - System-wide and per-user systemd services.

 -- bluetooth-autoconnect contributors <maintainers@example.com>  Tue, 01 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
